Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.73,0:00:03.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're about to exit the tunnel!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.07,0:00:08.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No! Not good! Darby's ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.95,0:00:10.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And by a full car length!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.83,0:00:12.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our speed is about to be doubled!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.79,0:00:14.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like I win!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.05,0:00:16.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.97,0:00:20.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The fact of the matter is, I still\Nhave more speed than you, Darby!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.93,0:00:23.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're in for it now!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.49,0:00:28.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.41,0:00:29.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe what I'm seeing!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.15,0:00:33.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cocculeen had enough power\Nto spin his car around
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.43,0:00:36.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and knock Darby's car\Nclear off the racetrack!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.25,0:00:38.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He used his speed to\Nhis advantage! Uh-huh!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.47,0:00:40.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's out of there!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.31,0:00:44.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Cocculeen's car is\Nsafely on the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.15,0:00:46.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.99,0:00:49.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The weaker car loses in a collision.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.67,0:00:53.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Giving up power to ram me will\Nprove to be a costly mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.19,0:00:54.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instead of gloating,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.39,0:00:56.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you should have paid more\Nattention to my plan to stay
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.43,0:00:59.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,behind and knock you off\Ncourse with a spin attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.79,0:01:03.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you say though the same\Ncould also be said of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.33,0:01:06.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Losing power was not an accident.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.05,0:01:10.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're so self-righteous in your hubris.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.39,0:01:14.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You didn't realize I planned for\Nyou to knock my car off course
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.63,0:01:16.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything rests on this
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.27,0:01:18.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look closely.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.51,0:01:20.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you see where my car is headed?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.37,0:01:34.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He landed on the other side,\Nfarther ahead at that! Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.03,0:01:37.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, ordinarily.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.47,0:01:39.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even at one's top speed,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.17,0:01:42.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a move like the one I just did\Nusually would result in a crash.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.85,0:01:45.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't make it by\Njumping over the curves.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.75,0:01:49.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's another story completely\Nif you're catapulted over them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.19,0:01:52.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I needed was your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.95,0:01:54.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From the moment we left the tunnel,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.93,0:01:58.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,my plan was to get you to hit\Nme by sacrificing my power.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.73,0:02:03.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That said, I think it's time we\Ncontinued our race, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.03,0:02:08.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let this guy get to\Nyou, Kakyoin! Stay focused!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.91,0:02:15.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kakyoin!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.97,0:02:19.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There, now his soul belongs to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.87,0:02:21.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The poor fool admitted defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.69,0:02:26.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He finally realized that it was\Npointless to continue racing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.01,0:02:30.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still, I must say,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.75,0:02:34.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you, Kakyoin, are the first opponent\Nto ever make me perspire like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.27,0:02:42.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Given its source material,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.11,0:02:47.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this doll will make a most exquisite\Naddition to my growing collection.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.85,0:02:51.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was the very first opponent\Nto muster up the courage to
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.11,0:02:55.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,conquer his fears and resist cracking\Nunder such colossal pressure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.53,0:03:06.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I will treasure his good company always.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.59,0:03:09.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Careful,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.51,0:03:11.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it would be in the best interest of all
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.49,0:03:14.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,involved for you to keep\Nyour emotions in check.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.41,0:03:16.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Harming me is out of the question.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.63,0:03:20.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, dying is something I simply\Ncan't do if you want your friend back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.89,0:03:23.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Slipping on a banana\Npeel and hitting my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.35,0:03:24.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,choking on gum,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.89,0:03:28.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,or even suffering a heart attack from\Nthe shock of popping a bag of popcorn.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.03,0:03:33.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If any of those things sent me to\Nheaven, Kakyoin's soul would go too.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:40.49,0:03:43.32,SC Opening 2 Eng,,0,0,0,,{\an8\pos(960,952.999)}Seeking out...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.79,0:04:00.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The end of the night, and the\Ndark in the end of the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.69,0:04:05.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the moon has been sent to\Nthe moonlight in the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.79,0:04:10.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know if it's\Nthe word of the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.09,0:04:12.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd never see the number of the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.79,0:04:15.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still in my own way,\Nand I'm still in my own way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.75,0:04:18.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I get to the end of the night,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.83,0:04:20.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm running back in the battle,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.07,0:04:36.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The end
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.75,0:04:43.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.25,0:04:48.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.91,0:04:52.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keine Ahitzabe,
Dialogue: 1,0:05:08.62,0:05:13.25,Title 3,title,0,0,0,,{\fad(488,639)\pos(150,858)}Episode 41: D'Arby the Player, Part 2
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.05,0:05:19.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hora, What the? Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.03,0:05:22.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jotaro, wait! What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.49,0:05:23.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.83,0:05:25.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why the hell are you sitting down?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.41,0:05:27.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should be kicking Geppetto's ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.45,0:05:28.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll play him next!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.93,0:05:32.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Old man, have you ever actually\Nplayed any of these games?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.47,0:05:35.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If not, the odds wouldn't\Nbe in your favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.85,0:05:39.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay out of it, old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.75,0:05:42.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't your average\Ngame of gin rummy after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.79,0:05:46.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're playing baseball.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.97,0:05:49.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the game I choose\Nto settle this once.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.73,0:05:54.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And for all as collateral,\NI'll bet my soul!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.75,0:05:57.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right then I would like to bet Kakyoin
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.05,0:06:03.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,soul my stand Atum has released your arm
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.45,0:06:09.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you may thank me at your leisure now that\NKakyoin soul is in my collection there's
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.21,0:06:13.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no longer reason for me to keep your arm\Nin my stands' clutches and suffice it
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.93,0:06:18.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to say i'd be at a bit of a disadvantage\Nif i faced you with my stand one handed!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.01,0:06:23.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm all aware of your star platinum's\Nincredible speed and precision!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.23,0:06:28.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really out of all the games\Nyou could have chosen to play
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.47,0:06:33.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's unfortunate for you that\Nwe're playing my specialty!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.47,0:06:35.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Darby!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.39,0:06:38.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just you wait the moment Jotaro\Nwipes the floor with you I'll
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.65,0:06:41.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,throttle the life out of your\Npompous ass and that is a promise!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.77,0:06:48.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh that's
