Dialogue: 1,0:06:49.18,0:06:49.22,SFX,1,0,0,0,,{=25}{\blur0.9\fade(255,0,255,-1970,-1870,-360,40)\frz1.816\pos(971.17,48.24)\fscx120\c&H171C2E&}Kablam
Dialogue: 2,0:06:49.18,0:06:49.22,SFX,1,0,0,0,,{=25}{\bord0\blur0.9\fade(255,0,255,-1970,-1870,-360,40)\frz1.816\pos(971.17,48.24)\fscx120\4a&HFF&}Kablam
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.95,0:06:55.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doesn't look like he's\Ntempered with this game either!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.19,0:06:56.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're good to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.55,0:06:59.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before we begin you'll\Nneed to pick your team!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.03,0:07:04.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jaguars
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.03,0:07:05.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jaguars!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.81,0:07:08.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.43,0:07:11.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've decided to go with a team\Nthat has a strong offense, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.01,0:07:14.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And two with a batting average over 400.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.71,0:07:18.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's how you're going to play\Nit, I'll choose the Red Dragons.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.19,0:07:19.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Red Dragons!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.91,0:07:22.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Offense or defense?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.37,0:07:23.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go on, take your pick.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.37,0:07:26.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Offense.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.29,0:07:29.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that case, the Jaguars will bat first.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.43,0:07:35.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next, you can begin designing your own\Nplayers by drawing their faces on the screen.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.09,0:07:39.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This handsome devil is Star Platinum.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.49,0:07:44.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that we've gotten the\Npreparations out of the way...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.85,0:07:45.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Playball!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.87,0:07:51.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jaguars versus Red Dragons!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.41,0:07:53.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Play ball!
Dialogue: 1,0:07:58.08,0:08:01.08,SC41 Sign 1,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1000,0)\pos(218,750)}Top of the 1st
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.15,0:08:03.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've chosen number 15 as my pitcher.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.09,0:08:06.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,January 5th is my birthday, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.65,0:08:11.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.67,0:08:13.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The pitcher is winding up!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.77,0:08:16.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The first pitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.03,0:08:18.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.01,0:08:21.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Strike one!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.03,0:08:26.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, hey, I don't get it! What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.31,0:08:28.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a pretty amateur move back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.17,0:08:33.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's great that you swung the bat and all,\Nbut it was before he even threw the ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.55,0:08:41.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what's this all about?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.03,0:08:45.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no need for you to\Npractice your swing, is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.13,0:08:46.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.33,0:08:50.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, is this the very first\Ntime you've ever played this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.99,0:08:54.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, have you ever played\Na video game in your life?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.09,0:08:57.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You answer me right now, Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.99,0:08:58.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.91,0:09:01.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I already know how to play baseball.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.29,0:09:03.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll figure out the game controls as I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.67,0:09:06.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.93,0:09:10.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In case you haven't noticed,\Nyour timing is totally off!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.09,0:09:11.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your swings are pathetic!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.15,0:09:15.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't lie. This is your\Nfirst time playing, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.45,0:09:25.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Strike two!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.47,0:09:31.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now you're actually swinging the bat\Nafter the catcher has caught the ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.09,0:09:32.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't know what you're doing!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.87,0:09:34.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dammit, Jotaro! I was right!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.71,0:09:37.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't know a video game\Nfrom a hole in the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.71,0:09:39.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Strike! Better out!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.79,0:09:42.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, it's time to get serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.77,0:09:45.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop trying to act cool\Nand use your blasted head!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.23,0:09:46.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bet your soul on this game,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.81,0:09:49.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so if you think you can back\Nout due to lack of experience,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.49,0:09:50.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,think again!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.41,0:09:51.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.51,0:09:53.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the worst pep\Ntalk I've ever heard.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.99,0:09:55.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should be more encouraging.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.37,0:09:59.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try something like, it's only the first\Ninning, you can still make a comeback.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.33,0:10:01.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell's going\Nthrough that head of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.37,0:10:05.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't possibly rely solely on Star\NPlatinum's reflexes to win this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.61,0:10:06.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.53,0:10:07.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.44,0:10:09.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't know the first\Nthing about video games!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.23,0:10:11.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are you supposed to beat him?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.83,0:10:13.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's your plan, Jotaro?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.65,0:10:14.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Answer me, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.97,0:10:17.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have a way to\Nbeat this weirdo or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.15,0:10:19.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.33,0:10:22.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.25,0:10:25.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if your strategy is to trick me\Nby pretending to be an amateur,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.47,0:10:28.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,let me inform you that\Nit isn't going to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.93,0:10:31.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd never be foolish enough\Nto let my guard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.73,0:10:34.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if you were a helpless\Nchild, it wouldn't happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.69,0:10:36.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A soul is at stake.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.57,0:10:38.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.87,0:10:42.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Since you wanted to know,\NI don't have a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.53,0:10:45.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,However, if I did have one,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.63,0:10:49.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the only thing it would involve would be\Nknocking the nose straight off the face?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.21,0:10:53.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of this condescending, overinflated douchebag\Nof a prick taking up space beside me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.01,0:10:56.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I care about is getting\NKakyoin's soul back.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.25,0:10:58.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do whatever it takes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.99,0:11:02.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You talk a big game,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.63,0:11:05.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it's still the top of the\Nfirst inning and you have won out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.69,0:11:07.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The match is far from over.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.57,0:11:09.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And since you haven't played before?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.49,0:11:13.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should know that if you fall\Nmore than 11 points behind you lose!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.09,0:11:20.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Second batter number three?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.69,0:11:25.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Strike!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.05,0:11:28.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn, he's getting even worse that time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.99,0:11:31.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He swung the bat over 40\Ncentimeters above the ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.53,0:11:32.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's he so bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.27,0:11:36.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Strike two what it wasn't even close
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.71,0:11:42.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Strike three! You're out!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.43,0:11:46.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.63,0:11:49.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro's no match for someone like Darby.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.25,0:11:52.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This massacre is like being forced\Nto watch a group of high school
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.33,0:11:56.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,baseball champs go head-to-head\Nwith kids from the knitting club.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.11,0:11:57.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's pathetic!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.85,0:11:59.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Strike one! Strike two!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.35,0:12:03.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, it wasn't a bluff.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.29,0:12:05.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He really is a beginner.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.81,0:12:06.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is too easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.51,0:12:10.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the same way a judo pro\Ncan gauge his opponent's
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.13,0:12:12.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,skill simply by looking at\Nthe way he wears his gi,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.71,0:12:14.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can read him like a book.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.81,0:12:18.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And chapter one is called\NJotaro, the Video Game Novice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.45,0:12:22.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All the same, I refuse\Nto let my guard down.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.57,0:12:26.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm aware of the weaknesses\Nof every batter in this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.49,0:12:29.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next will be a low pitch to the outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.55,0:12:35.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll throw my best pitch, the\Nfour-seam fastball, and strike him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.39,0:12:36.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the first inning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.95,0:12:39.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two outs, two strikes, and no fouls.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.41,0:12:40.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here comes my next pitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.09,0:12:41.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go right ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.45,0:12:46.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've pretty much gotten the hang\Nof batting with the controller.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.49,0:12:48.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what did he just say?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.45,0:12:50.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must have heard him wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.93,0:12:53.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does he mean, got the hang of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.15,0:12:57.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Surely he couldn't have...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.57,0:13:00.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is he talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.25,0:13:01.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does he mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.01,0:13:08.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.93,0:13:09.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.17,0:13:14.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, I'm really starting to\Nenjoy this game. What in the...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.27,0:13:16.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't be! It's going!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.75,0:13:18.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ball is still going!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.93,0:13:20.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It just doesn't make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.71,0:13:23.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did he mean by, got the hang of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.23,0:13:24.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got the hang of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.89,0:13:26.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got the hang of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.97,0:13:28.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.85,0:13:30.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.77,0:13:31.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.68,0:13:34.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know how, but he did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.23,0:13:37.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, run!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.61,0:13:45.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Home Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.17,0:13:47.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a home run!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.67,0:13:52.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro! Damn you!
