Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.95,0:14:03.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.87,0:14:06.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did I really hear you\Ncorrectly? Say something.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.21,0:14:10.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sounded like you've pretty\Nmuch gotten the hang of batting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.47,0:14:12.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't feel like repeating myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.75,0:14:17.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was a beginner when we\Nstarted this game. And yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.13,0:14:22.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he's claiming to have learned proper\Nswinging technique in only eight pitches.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.91,0:14:26.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro Code has all the speed\Nand dexterity of Star Platinum.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.59,0:14:32.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I know why Master Dio finds him to\Nbe problematic and why my brother lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.89,0:14:38.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.93,0:14:41.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I couldn't have asked for\Na more fitting opponent.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.93,0:14:44.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But as naturally gifted as you may be,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.91,0:14:49.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you made a critical mistake by revealing\Nyour talents so early in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.61,0:14:52.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A mistake that will cost you dearly.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.65,0:14:57.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's resume the game, Jotaro.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.67,0:15:04.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, he did it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.41,0:15:06.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's my boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.87,0:15:09.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another home run right out of the park!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.53,0:15:10.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Talk about a comeback!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.23,0:15:12.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Four runs in the first inning!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.03,0:15:16.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like you've got this\Ngame in the bag, Jotaro!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.19,0:15:19.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep it up, and we'll be\Nout of here in no time!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.89,0:15:24.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Darby, you'll just ignore me, but\NI'll say it anyway because I'm a nice guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.05,0:15:26.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm giving you an out.
