Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.67,0:17:27.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro he's just spouting\Nnonsense to shake your confidence
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.61,0:17:30.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,do yourself a favor and\Nignore everything he says.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.19,0:17:32.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Throw it Darby!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.33,0:17:35.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will you believe or will you doubt?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.73,0:17:42.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.93,0:17:45.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a fastball, and\Nit's coming right at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.57,0:17:48.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see is the ball\Ngoing to change direction?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.77,0:17:50.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The suspense is driving me crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.95,0:17:53.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You swung!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.29,0:17:55.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bought his act and\Nbet on the forkball!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.81,0:17:56.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's still going!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.09,0:17:58.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It actually is a fastball!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.91,0:18:02.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh great, he hit the bottom of the ball!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.41,0:18:05.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.65,0:18:07.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First inning, three outs change!
Dialogue: 1,0:18:08.56,0:18:11.57,SC41 Sign 1v2,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(1625,678)}Top of the 1st
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.45,0:18:13.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Idiot, how could you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.19,0:18:16.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leave it to a rookie\Nfor something like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.41,0:18:18.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you swung for a forkball!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.97,0:18:20.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmph.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.23,0:18:22.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.15,0:18:26.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He had already seen through me and knew\NI would swing expecting a forkball.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.31,0:18:28.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So we switched it up to a fastball.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.69,0:18:30.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he has a point, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.59,0:18:34.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something's been gnawing at me ever\Nsince we stepped foot in this mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.13,0:18:35.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure how.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.55,0:18:39.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he knew Star Platinum would throw\Na right punch in our earlier skirmish.
