Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.71,0:18:40.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.95,0:18:41.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.95,0:18:44.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you trying to tell me\Nthat he can read your mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.19,0:18:46.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No offense, Jotaro, but that's crazy talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.19,0:18:49.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, would you look at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.95,0:18:51.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's my turn at bat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.11,0:19:02.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is going to be a home run.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.71,0:19:08.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep your eye on the birdie, as I'll be\Nhitting it into the left field bleachers.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.69,0:19:12.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Old man, are you absolutely sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.27,0:19:14.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The game and console\Nhaven't been tampered with.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.35,0:19:17.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'm positive it's\Nclean and that's not all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.37,0:19:19.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't seen him make a\Nsingle funny move either.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.97,0:19:22.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then a secret weapon has\Nto be that stand of his.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.03,0:19:26.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His stand doesn't just take souls\Nit must have some other ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.93,0:19:30.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This will be my target.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.93,0:19:36.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now I'll get to the bottom of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.77,0:19:38.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Has he lost his mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.91,0:19:43.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's going to try to hit the batter on\Npurpose and where might you be aiming?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.41,0:19:48.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now Jotaro, an inside pitch\Nwill you throw it high or low?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.57,0:19:52.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps or maybe you're planning\Nsome kind of underhanded trick?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.49,0:19:53.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.87,0:20:05.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the people back with\NJotaro through the ball?
