Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.35,0:20:11.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He predicted it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.47,0:20:14.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He knew exactly what\Nwould happen. But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.09,0:20:19.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way he could have seen that\Npitch coming unless he read Jotaro's mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.21,0:20:20.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Home run!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.75,0:20:24.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's one run.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.25,0:20:27.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn this bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.45,0:20:29.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We faced all kinds of\Nopponents on this journey,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.93,0:20:31.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but never one who could read our minds.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.85,0:20:36.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you really can read minds, then it\Ndoesn't matter how clever we think we are.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.21,0:20:38.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We won't stand a\Nsnowball's chance in hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.25,0:20:41.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, what are you going to do?
