Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.27,0:21:19.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Home run!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.55,0:21:21.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Four to two.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.01,0:21:24.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.03,0:21:27.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A person's body language and\Nthe surrounding environment go
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.95,0:21:30.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a long way toward helping\Npredict an opponent's next move.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.75,0:21:33.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But there's no way to do\Nit perfectly and yet his
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.95,0:21:37.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stand predicts Jotaro's\Npitch with 100% accuracy and!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.97,0:21:39.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Technically, he's not cheating?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.47,0:21:42.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another home run!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.79,0:21:43.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's 4-3!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.53,0:21:47.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are we supposed to stop\Nhim from reading our minds?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.73,0:21:48.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.21,0:21:56.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At this rate, I'll be in the\Nlead in no time. Now what's next?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.29,0:22:00.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,An inside pitch, a fastball, a\Nhigh pitch, or maybe a curveball?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.75,0:22:02.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's up your sleeve?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.71,0:22:05.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.63,0:22:07.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.31,0:22:09.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.49,0:22:13.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you honestly take me for a cheat\Nlike my ne 'er-do-well brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.61,0:22:15.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jotaro, you've got it wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.27,0:22:16.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hiding your face is useless.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.03,0:22:18.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what he's doing,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.45,0:22:21.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but he's not watching the reflection\Nof the screen in your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.49,0:22:23.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get that it's hard not to go there now,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.85,0:22:27.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but there's no way he can see what you're\Npressing or what pitch you're choosing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.95,0:22:30.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trust me, I've been watching\Nhim the entire time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.13,0:22:32.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not what's been going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.45,0:22:34.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I only took off my hat\Nbecause I'm sweating.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.73,0:22:35.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No other reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.21,0:22:39.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could you throw your next\Npitch sometime this year?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.65,0:22:43.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I'm not going to be sweating anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.55,0:22:45.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you my next pitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.37,0:22:48.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm throwing a high outside fastball.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.43,0:22:51.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're joking! Totoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.73,0:22:54.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you hear what you're saying right now?
