Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.41,0:23:30.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you hear what you're saying right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.55,0:23:32.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Obviously, I just told him my next pitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.47,0:23:33.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.39,0:23:34.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's telling the truth!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.63,0:23:35.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.55,0:23:36.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You tampered with the console!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.51,0:23:37.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.43,0:23:39.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It must have something to\Ndo with that hat of yours!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.13,0:23:42.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is just a dance of deception\Nwhere the loser cries first.
